give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"Storytelling Today was a Mistake 2: Electric Boogaloo\"", "italic": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bounty Hunter", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing 1 evil player. If the player you know dies, you learn another evil player tonight. [1 Townsfolk is evil]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Sailor", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose an alive player: either you or they are drunk until dusk. You can't die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Balloonist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you learn a player of a different character type than last night. [+0 or +1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Snake Charmer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose an alive player: a chosen Demon swaps characters & alignments with you & is then poisoned."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Dreamer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose a player (not yourself or Travellers): you learn 1 good & 1 evil character, 1 of which is correct."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Gossip", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach day, you may make a public statement. Tonight, if it was true, a player dies."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Savant", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach day, you may visit the Storyteller to learn 2 things in private: 1 is true & 1 is false."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Alsaahir", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach day, if you publicly guess which players are Minion(s) and which are Demon(s), good wins."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Engineer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose which Minions or which Demon is in play."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Philosopher", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose a good character: gain that ability. If this character is in play, they are drunk."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Juggler", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOn your 1st day, publicly guess up to 5 players' characters. That night, you learn how many you got correct."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Alchemist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou have a Minion ability. When using this, the Storyteller may prompt you to choose differently."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Amnesiac", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou do not know what your ability is. Each day, privately guess what it is: you learn how accurate you are."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Mathematician", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you learn how many players' abilities worked abnormally (since dawn) due to another character's ability."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Hermit", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou have all Outsider abilities. [-0 or -1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Lunatic", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou think you are a Demon, but you are not. The Demon knows who you are & who you choose at night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Barber", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you died today or tonight, the Demon may choose 2 players (not another Demon) to swap characters."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Hatter", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you died today or tonight, the Minion & Demon players may choose new Minion & Demon characters to be."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Goon", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, the 1st player to choose you with their ability is drunk until dusk. You become their alignment."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Mezepheles", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou start knowing a secret word. The 1st good player to say this word becomes evil that night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Harpy", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose 2 players: tomorrow, the 1st player is mad that the 2nd is evil, or one or both might die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Cerenovus", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose a player & a good character: they are \"mad\" they are this character tomorrow, or might be executed."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Pit-Hag", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player & a character they become (if not in play). If a Demon is made, deaths tonight are arbitrary."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Wraith", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou may choose to open your eyes at night. You wake when other evil players do."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Organ Grinder", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nAll players keep their eyes closed when voting and the vote tally is secret. Each night, choose if you are drunk until dusk."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Yaggababble", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou start knowing a secret phrase. For each time you said it publicly today, a player might die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Lil' Monsta", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, Minions choose who babysits Lil' Monsta & \"is the Demon\". Each night*, a player might die. [+1 Minion]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Shabaloth", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose 2 players: they die. A dead player you chose last night might be regurgitated."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Kazali", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. [You choose which players are which Minions. -? to +? Outsiders]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bureaucrat", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nEach night, choose a player (not yourself): their vote counts as 3 votes tomorrow."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Cacklejack", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nEach day, choose a player: a different player changes character tonight."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Deviant", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nIf you were funny today, you cannot die by exile."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bishop", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nOnly the Storyteller can nominate. At least 1 opposing player must be nominated each day."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Voudon", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nOnly you & the dead can vote. They don't need a vote token to do so. A 50% majority isn't required."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Duchess", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nEach day, 3 players may choose to visit you. At night*, each visitor learns how many visitors are evil, but 1 gets false info."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Djinn", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nUse the Djinn's special rule. All players know what it is. (Speak with Storyteller)"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "LORIC", "bold": true, "color": "dark_green"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Zenomancer", "color": "dark_green", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_green"}, "\nOne or more players each have a goal. When achieved, that player learns a piece of true info."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "LORIC", "bold": true, "color": "dark_green"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bootlegger", "color": "dark_green", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_green"}, "\nThis script has custom rules:\n- An Amnesiac must be in play and can either be an outsider, minion or demon.\n\n..."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "LORIC", "bold": true, "color": "dark_green"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bootlegger", "color": "dark_green", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_green"}, "\n- Each game, at least one player must have a wizard wish\n- (Optional) Every player must have a zenomancer quest"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "LORIC", "bold": true, "color": "dark_green"}, "\n\n", {"text": "God of Ug", "color": "dark_green", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_green"}, "\nOne Ug hat. When wear Ug hat, must speak one sound at a time but vote twice. If fail, pass Ug hat."]],title:"Script Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "Storytelling Today was a Mistake 2: Electric Boogaloo Script", "italic": false, "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"Storytelling Today was a Mistake 2: Electric Boogaloo\"", "italic": false, "color": "dark_blue"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]